# Local-only Cloudflare Pages Functions secrets for `wrangler pages dev`.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) to test the Premium Listings / PayFast
# flow locally. These are PayFast's own publicly-documented sandbox demo
# credentials (confirmed against github.com/PayFast/payfast-php-sdk's
# README) — safe to commit, they only work against sandbox.payfast.co.za,
# never real money. Swap for a real merchant account's secrets (via
# `wrangler pages secret put`) before ever pointing PAYFAST_HOST at
# production — see the Premium Listings v2 plan.
PAYFAST_MERCHANT_ID=10000100
PAYFAST_MERCHANT_KEY=46f0cd694581a
PAYFAST_PASSPHRASE=jt7NOE43FZPn
PAYFAST_HOST=sandbox.payfast.co.za
# Optional, SANDBOX ONLY (ignored unless PAYFAST_HOST is exactly
# sandbox.payfast.co.za): override the subscription billing frequency sent
# to PayFast so a different real billing cycle can be tested without
# waiting for the business's own chosen cycle to come around. Valid codes:
# 3 = monthly, 4 = quarterly, 5 = biannual, 6 = annual. PayFast's docs also
# list 1 (daily) and 2 (weekly), but their live sandbox validation rejects
# both with a hard 400 ("frequency: The frequency must be at least 3."), so
# do not use them here — this cannot accelerate testing down to daily/
# weekly renewals. See checkoutFrequency() in functions/_lib/payfast.ts.
#PAYFAST_TEST_FREQUENCY=4

# Already-existing secrets this Function set also needs locally to test
# the full flow end to end (login, email, rebuild trigger) — leave blank
# to no-op those bits (see _lib/send-email.ts, _lib/deploy-hook.ts).
RESEND_API_KEY=
GITHUB_DISPATCH_TOKEN=
CRON_SECRET=local-test-secret
